      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree e814466cb05b53a824e4873b970655953281f9ed\nparent 33c6cc0943fe13d0c0dad3150ecb6f976b51c1bc\nauthor ViniciusCestarii <viniciuscestari01@gmail.com> 1795608908 -0300\ncommitter ViniciusCestarii <viniciuscestari01@gmail.com> 1795640718 -0300\n\nipc: expose Events interface\n\nAdd events.capnp and an Init.makeEvents method so IPC clients can\nsubscribe to chain and mempool events.\n\nlibmultiprocess does not map std::variant to capnp unions, so\ninterfaces::Event is converted to and from the Event union by hand in\nevents-types.h, reusing the generated code for each union member.\n\nAdd a functional test covering the interface.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgY7NROixtPE3hjThUiBvdMFhx+5\nJyj1M7a6RXrjRGqmMAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQB/p1IyCoVsCWCSeHs3kkrfRlcUFLXQLkJDch+8vR5vnp2UKe01ObJ7baQnO4SsbRs\nwh3LF2qSvzf5B00lipXgg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----"
